outline.prompt:
Generate the structure for a {duration_weeks}-week content calendar for {brand}.

Channels: {channels}
Topics: {topics}
Cadence: {cadence}
Start date: {start_date}

Research findings:
{all_findings}

Research log:
{research_log}

Create an outline that specifies:
1. Content themes per week (aligned to topics and trending angles)
2. Number of posts per channel per week based on cadence
3. Content mix strategy (educational, promotional, engagement, storytelling)
4. Keyword clusters per topic area
5. Cross-channel coordination plan

Be specific about dates and content types for each channel.
